OL,3,AUganda begins withdrawing troops from
OL,4,ASomalia after 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda has begun withdrawing its troops
OL,7,Ffrom Somalia after nearly two decades
OL,8,Fof military involvement in the country.
OL,10,FUganda's acting army spokesperson Chris
OL,11,FMagezi on Monday said the first group
OL,12,Fof troops deployed to Somalia through a
OL,13,Fbilateral arrangement had already
OL,14,Farrived back home and others would
OL,15,Ffollow in a few days' time.
OL,17,FHe said all forces, including those
OL,18,Funder the African Union (AU) mission,
OL,19,Fwould exit by the end of 2027 in the
OL,20,Fphased withdrawal.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
