OL,3,AUganda begins withdrawing troops from
OL,4,ASomalia after 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda was the first African country to
OL,7,Fdeploy troops to Somalia under the
OL,8,FAfrican Union Mission in Somalia
OL,9,F(Amisom), established in 2007 to help
OL,10,Fprotect the country's transitional
OL,11,Fgovernment from attacks by Islamist
OL,12,Fmilitants.
